From f4af752407f371f5a64a5a10db89e3799e39c6ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:32:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(review): bind the review overlay's hunk and file keys

The review overlay's ] [ } { were fixed keys. On layouts where they need
Option, AZERTY on macOS among them, Option is often the Alt that tuios
reads, so they could not be reached without a second Option key.

They are now the review_next_hunk, review_prev_hunk, review_next_file and
review_prev_file actions in a new [keybindings.review] section, with the
same keys as defaults. The footer hints, the help overlay and tuios
keybinds show the keys as bound.

Closes #585
